│ ► ALE/EDI data exchange between SAP systems           │
│ ► STMS uses RFC to distribute transport configurations │
│ ► Background jobs using external RFC servers          │
│ ► SAP Fiori connecting to backend ERP                 │
│ ► External apps (Java, .NET) calling SAP functions    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
