## 10.5 Job Monitoring (SM37) — Complete Reference

```
Transaction: SM37 → Overview of Job Selection

SELECTION SCREEN:
  Job Name           : Z_*          (wildcard - all Z jobs)
  Username           : BATCH_USER   (jobs scheduled by this user)
  From / To Date     : 01/01/2024 - 01/31/2024
  From / To Time     : 00:00:00 - 23:59:59
  Job Status Filters :
    ✅ Scheduled   → Waiting for trigger time
    ✅ Released    → Ready, waiting for free BTC WP
    ✅ Ready       → WP assigned, starting imminently
    ✅ Active      → Currently running RIGHT NOW
    ✅ Finished    → Completed (check spool for output)
    ✅ Cancelled   → FAILED (action required!)
    ✅ Intercepted → Held by job interception
    
JOB STATUS FLOW DIAGRAM:
  Scheduled → Released → Ready → Active → Finished
                                          ↘ Cancelled ❌

ACTIONS FROM SM37:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Action           │ How                │ When to Use      │
├─────────────────┼────────────────────┼──────────────────┤
│ Display Job Log  │ Select → Job Log   │ Investigate fail │
│ Display Spool   │ Select → Spool List│ View output      │
│ Release Job     │ Select → Release   │ Manually trigger │
│ Delete Job      │ Select → Delete    │ Remove unwanted  │
│ Copy Job        │ Select → Copy      │ Clone similar job│
│ Change Job      │ Select → Change    │ Edit schedule    │
│ Step Detail     │ Select → Steps     │ See program/var  │
└─────────────────┴────────────────────┴──────────────────┘
