## 12.1 Transport Management System (TMS) — Initial Setup

```
Transaction: STMS → Transport Management System

CORE CONCEPTS:
─────────────────────────────────────────────────
Transport Domain:
  ► A group of SAP systems that share one transport configuration
  ► Managed by the Transport Domain Controller (TDC)
  ► Only ONE domain controller per domain

Transport Domain Controller (TDC):
  ► The "master" system that stores all TMS configuration
  ► Usually: Production system or dedicated SolMan
  ► All other systems register with the TDC

Transport Directory:
  ► /usr/sap/trans/ — shared filesystem
  ► MUST be accessible (read/write) from ALL SAP systems
  ► Typically NFS-mounted from a central storage server
  ► If NFS is not possible: file copy using tp put/get
```

