## 16.3 SAP Support Packages (SPAM) — Complete Guide

```
SUPPORT PACKAGES = SAP's periodic bug fix and improvement releases

Types of Support Packages:
╔═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║ Type                    ║ Tool  ║ Target                        ║
╠═════════════════════════╬═══════╬═══════════════════════════════╣
