   ECC: BKPF + BSEG + BSAK + BSIK + BSAS... (many FI tables)
   S/4HANA: ACDOCA (Universal Journal — single table!)
   
   Impact on Basis:
   ► Database is MUCH smaller (less data redundancy)
   ► Faster queries (in-memory column store)
   ► Some old monitoring programs no longer relevant

3. FIORI AS DEFAULT UI:
