   S/4HANA: SAP Fiori primary, SAP GUI still available
   
   New Basis Tasks for S/4HANA:
   ► Fiori Launchpad configuration
   ► OData service management
   ► SICF (HTTP service activation)
   ► SAP Gateway administration

